"FsAgent.example\n  Returns an instance of the FsAgent.\n    {\n  \"_tag\": \"[FsAgent]\",\n  \"_scanner\": {\n    \"_rootPath\": \"<PROJECT_ROOT>\",\n    \"_tree\": null,\n    \"_watcher\": null,\n    \"_changeCallbacks\": [],\n    \"_options\": {\n      \"ignore\": [\n        \".sync-errors.log\",\n        \".fsagent-tmp-\",\n        \".fsagent-state.json\",\n        \".fsagent-signals.json\",\n        \".fsagent-recovered\"\n      ],\n      \"followSymlinks\": false,\n      \"bs\": {\n        \"blobs\": {}\n      },\n      \"settleMs\": 100\n    },\n    \"_ignoreMatcher\": {},\n    \"_bs\": {\n      \"blobs\": {}\n    },\n    \"_paused\": false,\n    \"_missedChangesDuringPause\": false,\n    \"_safetyTimer\": null,\n    \"_pausedAt\": null,\n    \"_autoResumeTimer\": null,\n    \"_stopRequested\": false,\n    \"_unsettledDuringScan\": [],\n    \"_scanStartedAt\": 0,\n    \"_growing\": {},\n    \"_settleTimer\": null,\n    \"_blobCache\": {},\n    \"_nextBlobCache\": {},\n    \"_cacheLoaded\": false,\n    \"_vanishedDuringScan\": 0,\n    \"_activeScan\": null,\n    \"_ownWrites\": {},\n    \"_pendingScan\": null\n  },\n  \"_adapter\": {\n    \"_bs\": {\n      \"blobs\": {}\n    }\n  },\n  \"_rootPath\": \"<PROJECT_ROOT>\",\n  \"_bs\": {\n    \"blobs\": {}\n  },\n  \"_restoreWritten\": 0,\n  \"_restoreSkipped\": 0,\n  \"_joinWaitMs\": 1500,\n  \"_restorePruned\": 0,\n  \"_restoreLocked\": [],\n  \"_restoreUnavailable\": [],\n  \"_restoreImpossible\": [],\n  \"_restoreRetyped\": 0,\n  \"_stageMs\": {},\n  \"_restoredBlobs\": {},\n  \"_timeouts\": {\n    \"dbQuery\": 10000,\n    \"fetchTree\": 20000,\n    \"extract\": 15000,\n    \"restore\": 15000,\n    \"debounceMs\": 300\n  },\n  \"_signals\": {\n    \"_signals\": [],\n    \"_totals\": {},\n    \"_listeners\": {},\n    \"_once\": {}\n  },\n  \"_signalsRestored\": false,\n  \"_ownContent\": {},\n  \"_watched\": {},\n  \"_stamping\": {},\n  \"_lock\": {},\n  \"_hubStatus\": null,\n  \"_receivers\": 0,\n  \"_partiallyApplied\": {},\n  \"_writtenEpochs\": \"{}\"\n}\n\nFsScanner - Scan file system\n  Scans a directory and extracts RLJSON tree structure"